   "evidence": "MeromorphicLaurent.lean:141-167 `private theorem analyticAt_taylor_decomp ... obtain \u27e8F, hF_an, hF_eq\u27e9 := hg0.exists_eventuallyEq_sum_add_pow_mul k ... fun z => F (z - s)`; PrincipalPart.lean:113-128 does the same with `hh'.exists_eventuallyEq_sum_add_pow_mul N` and `fun z \u21a6 F (z - a)`. Mathlib only has the version expanded at 0 (Mathlib/Analysis/Analytic/Order.lean:393), so the shared helper has to live in Tau Ceti.",
